Records requested. All emails, including attachments and replies, sent to o=
r received from either of these Oregon State Police addresses:
Captain Kyle Kennedy, Government and Media Relations (kyle.kennedy@osp.oreg=
on.gov)
OSP Public Information Officer (osppio@osp.oregon.gov<mailto:osppio@osp.ore=
gon.gov>)

that contain any of these terms:
"threat assessment"
"situational awareness"
"welfare check"
"knock and talk"
"grievance"

Date range: January 1, 2023, to the date of search.

We will begin gathering records responsive to your request, to the extent r=
ecords exist, and will be in touch.

Thanks,

Cameron D. Miles (he/him)
